    <div class="article-intro"><div class="article-hero"><img src="/assets/blog/recarga-condominio.webp" width="1280" height="720" alt="Property manager organizes residents and shared EV chargers" fetchpriority="high"></div><header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow"><span class="signal"></span>VeVolt guide</p><h1>Condominium EV charging management: organizing chargers and residents</h1><p class="lede">Condominium charging management turns an approved technical setup into a clear daily process for residents and property managers. Electrical design remains with qualified professionals; the app organizes participation and use.</p><p class="article-meta">Updated 03/08/2026 · 2 min read</p></header></div>
    <div class="article-layout"><div class="article-body"><section><h2>Map the approved operation</h2><p>List authorized residents, private chargers, operating hours and the person responsible for reviewing records. The schedule should reflect the capacity and rules already established by the building.</p></section><section><h2>Connect people, schedules and sessions</h2><p>A shared view should show who can book, which charger is reserved and how each completed session is recorded. VeVolt Condo supports up to 50 participants and 10 chargers; invited residents do not need Premium.</p><ul><li>Authorized participants</li><li>Approved chargers</li><li>Conflict-free booking</li><li>Manual session records</li><li>Monthly review</li></ul></section><section><h2>Use VeVolt Condo within its limits</h2><p>VeVolt organizes schedules, sessions, manual consumption and manual cost allocation. It does not control hardware, meter energy, bill residents, run OCPP or perform load balancing.</p></section><nav class="article-context-links" aria-label="Continue the condominium charging guide"><h2>Continue the condominium charging guide</h2><ul><li><a href="/en/condo">Explore VeVolt Condo</a></li><li><a href="/en/blog/electric-car-charger-in-condominium">Read the condominium charging pillar guide</a></li><li><a href="/en/blog/app-to-book-condominium-ev-charger">See how charger booking works</a></li></ul></nav><section><h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><div class="faq-list"><details class="faq-item"><summary>Does VeVolt replace an electrical assessment?</summary><p>No. Design, installation, metering and safety remain external professional responsibilities.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Do invited residents need Premium?</summary><p>No. Premium and Condo are separate subscriptions.</p></details><details class="faq-item"><summary>Is a trial available?</summary><p>Eligible new customers can try the monthly Condo plan free for 15 days through Google Play.</p></details></div></section></div>
    <aside class="article-aside"><h2>Organize with VeVolt Condo</h2><p>Organize residents, schedules, sessions and manual cost allocation with VeVolt Condo. Eligible new customers can try the monthly plan free for 15 days on Google Play.</p><a class="play-badge-link" href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=br.com.vevolt" rel="noopener" aria-label="Get it on Google Play"><img src="/assets/google-play-badge-en.png" width="564" height="168" alt="Get it on Google Play"></a><h2>Sources and further reading</h2><ul class="source-list"><li><a href="https://www.gov.br/aneel/pt-br/assuntos/veiculos-eletricos" rel="noopener noreferrer">ANEEL - Electric vehicles and charging rules</a></li><li><a href="https://www.agenciasp.sp.gov.br/governo-de-sp-sanciona-lei-que-permite-instalacao-de-carregadores-de-carros-eletricos-em-condominios/" rel="noopener noreferrer">São Paulo State Government - Charging in condominiums</a></li><li><a href="https://www.ba.gov.br/ssp/noticias/2026-05/88443/cbm-homologa-instrucao-tecnica-para-seguranca-em-recarga-de-veiculos" rel="noopener noreferrer">Bahia Fire Department - Safety at EV charging locations</a></li></ul></aside></div>
    <section class="section compact"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="kicker">Related guides</p><h2>Keep learning</h2></div></div><div class="grid two"><article class="article-card"><div class="article-card-body"><h3>How to allocate EV charging costs in a condominium</h3><p>Define data sources, rates, review steps and manual records for fair and transparent shared EV charging cost allocation.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/allocate-ev-charging-costs-condominium">Read article →</a></div></article><article class="article-card"><div class="article-card-body"><h3>EV charging station near me: how to find and verify one</h3><p>Learn how to find nearby EV chargers and check connector, power, access, price and recent conditions before leaving.</p><a class="text-link" href="/en/blog/ev-charging-station-near-me">Read article →</a></div></article></div></section>
